# 🧭 **What is ATOS?**

ATOS is an **autonomous task orchestration system** built to simulate how real-world AI products work:

* A main **Orchestrator agent** supervises tasks
* A **Coder agent** handles code generation & improvements
* A **Small agent** executes quick, narrow subtasks
* All agents call **external LLM APIs** (OpenAI, Anthropic, Google, etc)
* The system coordinates them with a clean architecture, modular components, and future extensibility

This project teaches you *every discipline required to build actual AI software products*:

* Architecture
* Backend
* API design
* Agent design & routing
* Cloud & deployment fundamentals
* Logging & analytics
* Product thinking
* Collaboration patterns

ATOS is not just code — it is a **full product-building curriculum disguised as a project**.

