# 🧠 **High-Level System Idea**

ATOS consists of **three agents**:

| Agent            | Purpose                                          | Example Models                           |
| ---------------- | ------------------------------------------------ | ---------------------------------------- |
| **Orchestrator** | Decomposes tasks, decides what happens next      | GPT-4.1-mini, Claude Haiku, Gemini Flash |
| **Coder Agent**  | Writes or improves code                          | Claude Sonnet, GPT-4.1, Qwen Coder       |
| **Small Agent**  | Quick reasoning tasks, formatting, summarization | Gemini Flash, GPT-4o-mini                |

Everything is **API-powered**.
No local models, no VRAM limits, no heavy setup.

