# 🌐 **API Call Flow (Detailed Diagram)**

```
User → Orchestrator → Model API → Orchestrator → Agent → Model API → Orchestrator → Output
```

In full detail:

```
1. User sends request
2. Orchestrator:
   • parses goal
   • decides tasks
   • selects agent
   • prepares prompt

3. Orchestrator calls the model via API client
4. Response returned to Orchestrator
5. If needed:
   • Orchestrator delegates to Coder Agent or Small Agent
   • Agents call their own APIs

6. Agents return responses back to Orchestrator
7. Orchestrator merges & finalizes answer
8. User receives structured output
```

