# 🔧 **How It Actually Works (Key Components)**

## 1. Orchestrator (`agents/orchestrator.py`)

* central brain
* decomposes tasks
* calls correct agent
* merges outputs
* ensures quality & consistency

## 2. Coder Agent (`agents/coder.py`)

* specialized code generator
* can critique, improve, refactor

## 3. Small Agent (`agents/small_agent.py`)

* fast helper
* basic reasoning
* formatting
* summarization

## 4. Router (`core/router.py`)

* where to send which task
* defines routing rules

## 5. API Client (`services/api_client.py`)

* unified interface for:

  * OpenAI API
  * Anthropic API
  * Gemini API
* handles:

  * headers
  * retries
  * error handling

